FRANCESC CAMPOY: Great.

00:05:39.078 --> 00:05:42.570
So I guess it's now time,
after judging dogs and cats,

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:45.880
to go talk with David East about
Cloud Functions for Firebase

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:46.770
and Firebase Hosting.

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:47.850
MARK MANDEL: Let's do it.

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:51.840
Today, I am very pleased to
