00:30:16.929 --> 00:30:17.470
I don't know.

00:30:17.470 --> 00:30:19.180
I see him all the time
around the office,

00:30:19.180 --> 00:30:20.260
so it's hard to tell.

00:30:20.260 --> 00:30:23.380
And tell us a little bit about
Cloud Functions for Firebase

00:30:23.380 --> 00:30:24.730
and Firebase hosting.

00:30:24.730 --> 00:30:26.830
Lots of really cool
stuff, especially when

00:30:26.830 --> 00:30:31.030
you want to get started easily
and just have a simple website,

00:30:31.030 --> 00:30:32.080
just put it there.

00:30:32.080 --> 00:30:32.770
Super simple.

